 "titulo": "The monkey who was born from a stone 🐒 Part 1 #mythology #shorts",
 "capa": "BORN FROM A STONE",
 "descripcion": "Before he was Sun Wukong, he was a monkey born from a stone on Flower-Fruit Mountain.\n\nFrom Journey to the West, by Wu Cheng'en (16th century), chapter 1.\n\nWhat would make a king cry?\n\n#mythology #monkeyking #sunwukong #chinesemythology #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "On a mountain in the eastern sea, a stone sat since the world began.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One day it cracked, and a monkey made of stone stepped out.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "His eyes shot two beams of light, all the way to Heaven.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "The monkeys found a waterfall, and made a deal.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Whoever jumps through and comes back, becomes our king.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The stone monkey jumped.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind the water was a cave, and he became the Monkey King.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Years later, at a feast, he began to cry. Why? Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
